    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toboŋo Yakob Besel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Akuj neni a Yakob, “Tonyou, kitipeiyo Besel kiboi a nen. Todukok Namuroet nen ŋina ka Akuj a ŋina abu totakanu neni kon apaki ŋina isiya iyoŋ aneni alokaato kon ke Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Yakob tolimok ŋituŋa a ekal keŋ ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu arukitotor iŋes tema, “Tocakasi nariet ŋakujo ŋunagelaanotin ŋuna iyakatar iyes. Kitaleutu ŋawat kus ka tonapa ŋilowi ŋice; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ipotu nai oloto etipeiyosi Besel; ikotere ayoŋ adukokini nen Namuroet ŋina ka Akuj a ŋina abu ekeira ayoŋ apaki ŋina aryamunitor ŋican. Akuj ŋina abu torubak ikirukit ka ayoŋ aneni daadaŋ abu ayoŋ etor.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, inakis ŋituŋa ŋakujo ŋuna ayakatar ikes daadaŋ ŋunagelae neni a Yakob. Inakis ŋikadoŋidoŋ kec daŋ neni a Yakob; kiwua Yakob ŋul daadaŋ alodiyete ekuyon ŋolo ayai Sekem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa ikes ewosete, min ekabule lotaunio daadaŋ ŋulu aya nawaetin kec, aŋun, emam ituŋanan abu totupak ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todolut Yakob ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu arukito ka iŋes Lus (iŋes Besel) nakibois ŋina ayai Kanaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Yakob Namuroet nen, tonyara ekiro a akibois a ŋin El Besel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "El Besel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Iŋes atemar Akuj ŋina a Besel",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " anerae arae nen abunio Akuj totakanunia neni a Yakob apaki ŋina arotokinio aneni alokaato keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, totwana Debora ŋina apolouni Rebeka aneni keŋ; tonukae iŋes kwap ekuyon natiyaaret kwap Besel. Aŋun, aponi tonyarae ekiro a akibois a ŋin lokuyon ŋolo Alon-Bakus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "alon-Bakus",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Iŋes atemar ekuyon ŋolo igworore.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totakanu nabo Akuj neni a Yakob apaki ŋina abunio iŋes alo Padanaram. Kiterereŋ Akuj iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Akuj neni keŋ, “Erae ekiro kon Yakob; nyeriŋa nabo ikinyarao iyoŋ Yakob, nai ikinyarao iyoŋ Isirael.” Aŋun, abu Akuj tonyara ekiro keŋ Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Akuj neni keŋ, “Arae ayoŋ Akuj ŋina Etiron: Topit, tolalata ŋituŋa kon; elomunete aneni kon ŋituŋa ŋulu ka akwap a apei ka ŋituŋa ŋulu a ŋakwapin a ŋuna alalak, elomunete ŋirwosi aneni kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akainakini ayoŋ iyoŋ akwap ŋina abu oinak Aburaam ka Isaka, ainakini neni a ŋiletok kon ekaku kon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimyek nai Akuj Yakob a nen anakibois a ŋina erworotor ka iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosipok Yakob amoru nen nakibois ŋina abunio iŋes kirworikinotor ka Akuj; tobukok namoru epiini erae ainakinet, tobukok daŋ namoru ŋin akimyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Yakob ekiro a akibois a ŋina abunio Akuj kisirworya iŋes a ŋin Besel ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Besel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Iŋes atemar Akai ka Akuj",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akidouno a Benjamin ka atwanare a Rakel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis ikes alo Besel; ani eriŋa elwaka iwadio alo Epurat, toryebakin Rakel akidoun. Toryebakin iŋes nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eryeba iŋes nooi, tolimok akesidoununon iŋes tema, “Nyikuryaniar, anerae idouni iyoŋ tokona isapat ice.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa etau keŋ itedukae (aŋuna alosyo akiridakin), abu tolimok ekiro a idya keŋ a ŋin Benoni, nai abu papa a idya tolimok ekiro a idya Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totwan Rakel a nen, tonukae kidiŋ neni aya ikes ka Epurat (iŋes Betelem). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosipok Yakob amoru kidiama alyal a Rakel; tari tokona eyai amoru ŋin neni ka alyal a Rakel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotok Isirael a nen kiŋaren, kigurok eema keŋ yaye aduketait ŋina aoyan alotaun ke Eder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa Isirael iboi anakwap a ŋin, kebu Ruben tolot tolom Bila, apese a papa keŋ ŋina pa eisitae, kiira Isirael ŋakiro ŋun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar Yakob ŋidwe ŋitomon ka ŋiarei: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋidwe a Lea ikes lu: Ruben iŋes lokoku a Yakob ŋolo kiyae, totupak Simeon, Lepi, Yuda ka Isakar ta Sebulon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋidwe a Rakel ikes lu: Yosepu ka Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋidwe a Bila aketiyan a Rakel ikes lu: Dan ka Naputali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋidwe a Silpa aketiyan a Lea ikes lu: Gad ka Aser. Arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋidwe ŋulu abu Yakob touru alo Padanaram.",
          "type": "text",
