        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku, totwana Isaka emojoŋit nooi elalak ŋikaru, ido yaasi iŋes ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa, Esau ka Yakob, tonuka neni anukitae ŋituŋa keŋ.",
